<p>BOLI RO RO KE MAA ALI ASGHAR ASWS. AY MERE NEEM JAA'N ALI ASGHAR ASWS.</p>

<p>TUJHKO DHUNDU KAHAN ALI ASGHAR ASWS..*2</p>

<p>AY MERE NEEM JAA'N ALI ASGHAR ASWS.</p>

<p>1. LAB PE BANO KE THA YAHI NAUHA.</p>

<p>GODH QAALI HUI MERE BETA.</p>

<p>KISKO DU LORIYA'N ALI ASGHAR ASWS..*2.</p>

<p>AY MERE NEEM JAA'N....</p>

<p>2. DEKE RAAH E QUDA JJH. MEIN JAA'N APNI.</p>

<p>TUNE IZZAT BADHAAYI HAIN MERI.</p>

<p>TUJHPE QURBAA'N YEH MAA ALI ASGHAR ASWS..*2.</p>

<p>AY MERE NEEM JAA'N.....</p>

<p>3. HAR GHADI YAAD TERI AATI HAIN.</p>

<p>TERI FURQAT MUJHE RULATI HAIN.</p>

<p>TUJHKO KO DHUNDU KAHAN ALI ASGHAR ASWS..*2.</p>

<p>AY MERE NEEM JAA'N....</p>

<p>4. DEEN E ISLAAM KI BAQA KE LIYE.</p>

<p>AY MERE LAAL DE DIYA TUNE.</p>

<p>HASKE HAR IMTEHAA'N ALI ASGHAR ASWS..*2.</p>

<p>AY MERE NEEM JAA'N....</p>

<p>5. AAG QAIMON MEIN HAAYE AISI LAGI.</p>

<p>MERE HUMRAAH TERE JHOOLE KI.</p>

<p>REH GAYI LAKDIYAA'N ALI ASGHAR ASWS..*2.</p>

<p>AY MERE NEEM JAA'N...</p>

<p>6. TERE MARNE SE AY MERE DILBAR.</p>

<p>KIS TARHA SE KAHUN MERE SAR PAR.</p>

<p>GIR PADA AASMAA'N ALI ASGHAR ASWS..*2.</p>

<p>AY MERE NEEM JAA'N....</p>

<p>7. BOLI SAHIL YEH BANO E DUKHIYA S.A.</p>

<p>JAA RAHA HAI UTHO MERE BETA.</p>

<p>AB WATAN KAARWAA'N ALI ASGHAR ASWS..*2.</p>

<p>AY MERE NEEM JAA'N ALI ASGHAR ASWS.</p>

<p><center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB ALAMDAR SAHIL SAHAB.</h4></center><br />
